  "introduction": "<div id=\"portland\" class=\"span-24 last conference-title\">\n<h1>OpenStack Conference Spring 2013</h1>\n<h2>April 15-18, 2013, Portland, Oregon</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"span-24 last conference-summary\">\n<div id=\"portland-cal\" class=\"span-8 conference-calendar\">\n<p class=\"date\">April 15, 16, 17, 18</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"two-events\" class=\"span-10\">\n<p><strong>Thanks for attending!</strong> The OpenStack Summit is a four-day conference for developers, users, and administrators of OpenStack Cloud Software.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
